Package: WISP
Type: Package
Title: Window Mean Survival Time Regression for Interval-Censored Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hao", "Chen", email = "hche2036@uni.sydney.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Clara", "Grazian", role = "aut"))
Description: Covariate-adjusted window mean survival time regression for
    interval-censored outcomes using midpoint reconstruction, Kaplan-Meier
    estimation and infinitesimal jackknife pseudo-observations. Includes
    right-endpoint sensitivity analysis and a complete-response inverse
    probability weighting extension for baseline-dependent monotone dropout
    on a common assessment grid, with stacked sandwich inference.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: survival, stats
Suggests: icensBKL
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/WISP
BugReports: https://github.com/haohaostats/WISP/issues
